    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88240" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπαρασκευ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prepare beforehand,</i>
			
